<div class="guide-styles" data-zaf-dynamic="article" id="guide-body" lang="en">Welcome to Wowhead's Pre-Raid Best in Slot Gear list for Holy Priest Healer in Cataclysm Classic. This guide will list the recommended gear for your class and role, containing gear sourced from raids, dungeons, PvP, professions, Bind on Equip drops, and reputations.<h2 class="heading-size-2" id="best-in-slot">Best in Slot Gear for Holy Priest Healer Pre-Raid</h2>
<i>Healer gearing always heavily depends on playstyle, situation and raid environment so treat the BiS list below as a guideline rather than a gospel.</i>
<br/>
<br/>While there is a variety of different pieces that can be considered Pre-Raid BiS, some of them naturally end up being expensive BoEs or behind luck-based <a class="icontiny" data-entity="skill" data-game="wow" data-type="skill" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/skill=794/archaeology">
<img alt="Archaeology" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/trade_archaeology.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Archaeology</span></a> grinds.<ul>
<li>
<div data-markup-content-target="1">
<a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=62050/darkmoon-card-tsunami">
<img alt="Darkmoon Card: Tsunami" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_inscription_tarot_tsunamicard.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Darkmoon Card: Tsunami</span></a> requires you to find 8 cards to complete the <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=62044/tsunami-deck">
<img alt="Tsunami Deck" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_ticket_tarot_stack_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Tsunami Deck</span></a>, which can also be purchased from the Auction House.</div></li>
<li>
<div data-markup-content-target="1">
<a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=67130/dorians-lost-necklace">
<img alt="Dorian's Lost Necklace" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_forestnecklace.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Dorian's Lost Necklace</span></a>, <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=67131/ritssyns-ruminous-drape">
<img alt="Ritssyn's Ruminous Drape" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_cape_cataclysm_caster_c_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Ritssyn's Ruminous Drape</span></a>, <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=67147/jetzes-sparkling-tiara">
<img alt="Je'Tze's Sparkling Tiara" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_helmet_cloth_raidpriest_i_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Je'Tze's Sparkling Tiara</span></a> and <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=67149/heartbound-tome">
<img alt="Heartbound Tome" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_book_17.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Heartbound Tome</span></a> are all great opions in their respective slots, however, they are BoE World Drops, which will end up being a costly purchase via the Auction House.</div></li>
<li>
<div data-markup-content-target="1">
<a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=54504/belt-of-the-depths">
<img alt="Belt of the Depths" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_belt_cloth_raidpriest_i_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Belt of the Depths</span></a> and <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=54505/breeches-of-mended-nightmares">
<img alt="Breeches of Mended Nightmares" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_pant_cloth_raidpriest_i_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Breeches of Mended Nightmares</span></a> are powerful options from <a class="icontiny" data-entity="skill" data-game="wow" data-type="skill" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/skill=197/tailoring">
<img alt="Tailoring" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/trade_tailoring.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Tailoring</span></a>. If you are not a Tailor yourself, this can end up being another expensive purchase from the Auction House.</div></li>
<li>
<div data-markup-content-target="1">
<a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=64880/staff-of-ammunae">
<img alt="Staff of Ammunae" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/trade_archaeology_staff-of-ammunrae.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Staff of Ammunae</span></a>, <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=64904/ring-of-the-boy-emperor">
<img alt="Ring of the Boy Emperor" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/trade_archaeology_ring-of-the-boyemperor.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Ring of the Boy Emperor</span></a> and <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=64645/tyrandes-favorite-doll">
<img alt="Tyrande's Favorite Doll" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/trade_archaeology_tyrandesfavoritedoll.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Tyrande's Favorite Doll</span></a> are all excellent options from <a class="icontiny" data-entity="skill" data-game="wow" data-type="skill" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/skill=794/archaeology">
<img alt="Archaeology" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/trade_archaeology.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Archaeology</span></a> which can be particularly time consuming dependent on your luck.</div></li></ul>Due to this, the gear embed below has both an optimized and a more realistic setup to choose from, though most players will likely end up with something inbetween. <br/>
<br/>As a quick recap, these are the stats we are mainly looking for on our Pre-BiS pieces, as they will be the most impactful when first stepping into a raid:<ol>
<li>
<div data-markup-content-target="1">Intellect - As a primary and most important stat, we shall always prioritize Intellect when evaluating a new gear piece.</div></li>
<li>
<div data-markup-content-target="1">Spirit - As sustain can typically be an issue at this point when undergeared, opting for Spirit over the other secondary stats on otherwise equal pieces is a safe choice.</div></li>
<li>
<div data-markup-content-target="1">Haste Rating - Haste is fairly great, but only when your Mana pool can sustain it. Additionally, the Haste breakpoints will influence your priority of this stat.</div></li>
<li>
<div data-markup-content-target="1">Mastery - Despite being a lower priority than the other stats listed, Mastery is still a close fourth behind Haste and is still vital for your overall kit.</div></li>
<li>
<div data-markup-content-target="1">Critical Strike Rating - The lowest priority stat for a Holy Priest as the stat sees the most benefit when single target healing, however, it is not one to be ignored as it provides you with opportunities to proc <a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/spell=88690/surge-of-light">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/spell_holy_surgeoflight.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Surge of Light</span></a> and <a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/spell=15362/inspiration">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/spell_holy_layonhands.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Inspiration</span></a>.</div></li></ol>You will want to socket <a class="q3 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=52207/brilliant-inferno-ruby">
<img alt="Brilliant Inferno Ruby" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_cutgemsuperior6.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Brilliant Inferno Ruby</span></a> gems in the majority of your sockets regardless of color, unless the socket is better than the overall gain from <a class="q3 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=52207/brilliant-inferno-ruby">
<img alt="Brilliant Inferno Ruby" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_cutgemsuperior6.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Brilliant Inferno Ruby</span></a>. Bear in mind that <a class="q3 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=52296/ember-shadowspirit-diamond">
<img alt="Ember Shadowspirit Diamond" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_metagem_b.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Ember Shadowspirit Diamond</span></a> requires 2 yellow gems to activate, so you will need to socket a minimum of two <a class="q3 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=52208/reckless-ember-topaz">
<img alt="Reckless Ember Topaz" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_cutgemsuperior4.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Reckless Ember Topaz</span></a>. Outside of that, <a class="q3 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=52236/purified-demonseye">
<img alt="Purified Demonseye" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_cutgemsuperior3.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Purified Demonseye</span></a> are a great gem for Holy Priests.<br/>
<br/>
