<h3 class="heading-size-3" id="justice-points">Justice Points for Holy Priest Healer Pre-Raid</h3>
<a class="icontiny q1" data-entity="currency" data-game="wow" data-type="currency" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/currency=395/justice-points">
<span>
<img alt="Justice Points" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/pvecurrency-justice.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Justice Points</span></span></a> are the Cataclysm version of <a class="icontiny q1" data-entity="currency" data-game="wow" data-type="currency" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/currency=101/emblem-of-heroism">
<span>
<img alt="Emblem of Heroism" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/spell_holy_proclaimchampion.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Emblem of Heroism</span></span></a>, which means that they can be obtained by killing bosses in Heroic Dungeons and completing Random Dungeons through the Random Dungeon Finder tool. The main vendors you can exchange these at to obtain gear are <a data-entity="npc" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/npc=46555/gunra">
<span class="tinyicontxt">Gunra</span></a> for the Horde and <a data-entity="npc" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/npc=44246/magatha-silverton">
<span class="tinyicontxt">Magatha Silverton</span></a> for the Alliance.<br/>
<br/>
<a class="q3 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=58153/robes-of-embalmed-darkness">
<img alt="Robes of Embalmed Darkness" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_chest_robe_dungeonrobe_c_04.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Robes of Embalmed Darkness</span></a>, <a class="q3 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=58160/leggings-of-charity">
<img alt="Leggings of Charity" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_pants_robe_dungeonrobe_c_04.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Leggings of Charity</span></a> and <a class="q3 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=58158/gloves-of-the-painless-midnight">
<img alt="Gloves of the Painless Midnight" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_gauntlets_robe_dungeonrobe_c_04.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Gloves of the Painless Midnight</span></a> provide the most value and should be your first purchases, depending on your luck in <a data-entity="zone" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/zone=5600/baradin-hold">
<span class="tinyicontxt">Baradin Hold</span></a>.<br/>
<br/>
<a class="q3 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=57922/belt-of-the-falling-rain">
<img alt="Belt of the Falling Rain" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_belt_robe_dungeonrobe_c_04.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Belt of the Falling Rain</span></a> can most likely be skipped if you've already managed to obtain the crafted BoE item <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=54504/belt-of-the-depths">
<img alt="Belt of the Depths" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_belt_cloth_raidpriest_i_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Belt of the Depths</span></a> or obtained enough reputation with the <a data-entity="faction" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/faction=1158/guardians-of-hyjal">
<span class="tinyicontxt">Guardians of Hyjal</span></a> for <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=62386/cord-of-the-raven-queen">
<img alt="Cord of the Raven Queen" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_belt_cloth_raidpriest_i_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Cord of the Raven Queen</span></a>.<br/>
<br/>
<a class="q3 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=57924/apple-bent-bough">
<img alt="Apple-Bent Bough" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_staff_08.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Apple-Bent Bough</span></a>, <a class="q3 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=58161/mask-of-new-snow">
<img alt="Mask of New Snow" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_helm_robe_dungeonrobe_c_04.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Mask of New Snow</span></a>, <a class="q3 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=57934/celadon-pendant">
<img alt="Celadon Pendant" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_jewelry_necklace_46.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Celadon Pendant</span></a> and <a class="q3 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=58162/summer-song-shoulderwraps">
<img alt="Summer Song Shoulderwraps" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_shoulder_robe_dungeonrobe_c_04.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Summer Song Shoulderwraps</span></a> are only worth getting if you haven't been so lucky with <a class="icontiny" data-entity="skill" data-game="wow" data-type="skill" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/skill=794/archaeology">
<img alt="Archaeology" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/trade_archaeology.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Archaeology</span></a>, or are behind with various reputation grinds.<br/>
<br/>
