<h3 class="heading-size-3" id="body-armor">Body Armor for Holy Priest Healer</h3>
<h4 class="heading-size-4" id="head-for-holy-priest-healer">Head for Holy Priest Healer</h4>While <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=59449/lightweight-bio-optic-killshades">
<img alt="Lightweight Bio-Optic Killshades" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_gizmo_newgoggles.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Lightweight Bio-Optic Killshades</span></a> requires you to have Engineering, it is by far the strongest helmet you can acquire before stepping into raids. The second option being <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=67147/jetzes-sparkling-tiara">
<img alt="Je'Tze's Sparkling Tiara" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_helmet_cloth_raidpriest_i_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Je'Tze's Sparkling Tiara</span></a>, which is a BoE World drop and will be fairly expensive.<br/>
<br/>
<a class="q3 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=58161/mask-of-new-snow">
<img alt="Mask of New Snow" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_helm_robe_dungeonrobe_c_04.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Mask of New Snow</span></a> is your best alternative and is easily obtainable via <a class="icontiny q1" data-entity="currency" data-game="wow" data-type="currency" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/currency=395/justice-points">
<span>
<img alt="Justice Points" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/pvecurrency-justice.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Justice Points</span></span></a>.<br/>
<br/>
<b>Recommended BiS Helm Enchant</b>: <a class="q7 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=62367/arcanum-of-hyjal">
<img alt="Arcanum of Hyjal" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/spell_fire_masterofelements.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Arcanum of Hyjal</span></a>, requires Revered reputation with <a data-entity="faction" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/faction=1158/guardians-of-hyjal">
<span class="tinyicontxt">Guardians of Hyjal</span></a>.<div class="pad"></div>
