<h4 class="heading-size-4" id="shoulders-for-holy-priest-healer">Shoulders for Holy Priest Healer</h4>
<a class="q3 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=56324/kyrstel-mantle">
<img alt="Kyrstel Mantle" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_shoulder_robe_dungeonrobe_c_03.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Kyrstel Mantle</span></a> is the best choice for the Shoulder slot and is easily obtainable from <a data-entity="zone" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/zone=4926/blackrock-caverns">
<span class="tinyicontxt">Blackrock Caverns</span></a> Heroic. The other optional choices hold up well with support from <a href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/guide/item-reforging-overview">Reforging</a>.<br/>
<br/>
<b>Recommended BiS Shoulder Enchant</b>: <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=62343/greater-inscription-of-charged-lodestone">
<img alt="Greater Inscription of Charged Lodestone" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_gem_bloodstone_02.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Greater Inscription of Charged Lodestone</span></a>, requires Revered reputation with <a data-entity="faction" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/faction=1171/therazane">
<span class="tinyicontxt">Therazane</span></a>, or <a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/spell=86403/felfire-inscription">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_mastersinscription.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Felfire Inscription</span></a> - Only Inscribers may apply Shoulder Inscriptions on their own Shoulders.<div class="pad"></div>
