<h4 class="heading-size-4" id="back-for-holy-priest-healer">Back for Holy Priest Healer</h4>
<a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=67131/ritssyns-ruminous-drape">
<img alt="Ritssyn's Ruminous Drape" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_cape_cataclysm_caster_c_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Ritssyn's Ruminous Drape</span></a> is the best option, however, as a BoE World drop, it isn't a very realistic option. We also don't want to be prioritizing our <a class="icontiny q1" data-entity="currency" data-game="wow" data-type="currency" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/currency=396/valor-points">
<span>
<img alt="Valor Points" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/pvecurrency-valor.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Valor Points</span></span></a> for this slot therefore, the best, most realistic option is <a class="q3 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=56434/solar-wind-cloak">
<img alt="Solar Wind Cloak" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_cape_cataclysm_healer_c_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Solar Wind Cloak</span></a> from <a data-entity="zone" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/zone=4945/halls-of-origination">
<span class="tinyicontxt">Halls of Origination</span></a> and we can look to use <a href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/guide/item-reforging-overview">Reforging</a> to obtain more Haste if necessary.<br/>
<br/>
<b>Recommended BiS Cloak Enchant</b>: <a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/spell=74240/enchant-cloak-greater-intellect">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/trade_engraving.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Enchant Cloak - Greater Intellect</span></a> with <a class="q1 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=39300/spring-loaded-cloak-expander">
<img alt="Spring Loaded Cloak Expander" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_gizmo_05.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Spring Loaded Cloak Expander</span></a> - Only Engineers may apply the Slow Fall modification on their own Cloak.<div class="pad"></div>
<table class="grid max-width">
<tbody>
<tr>
<td data-background="c5" style="width: 10%; max-width: 100%;">
<b>Rank</b></td>
<td data-background="c5" style="width: 25%; max-width: 100%;">
<b>Item</b></td>
<td data-background="c5" style="width: 20%; max-width: 100%;">
<b>Sockets</b></td>
<td data-background="c5" style="width: 23%; max-width: 100%;">
<b>Source</b></td>
<td data-background="c5" style="width: 22%; max-width: 100%;">
<b>Location</b></td></tr>
<tr>
<td>Best</td>
