<h4 class="heading-size-4" id="chest-for-holy-priest-healer">Chest for Holy Priest Healer</h4>In the chest slot we will want to save up our <a class="icontiny q1" data-entity="currency" data-game="wow" data-type="currency" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/currency=396/valor-points">
<span>
<img alt="Valor Points" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/pvecurrency-valor.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Valor Points</span></span></a> and spend them here first for the <a data-entity="item-set" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item-set=935/mercurial-vestments">
<span class="tinyicontxt">Mercurial Vestments</span></a> set piece. Prior to that, you can get <a class="q3 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=58153/robes-of-embalmed-darkness">
<img alt="Robes of Embalmed Darkness" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_chest_robe_dungeonrobe_c_04.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Robes of Embalmed Darkness</span></a> through <a class="icontiny q1" data-entity="currency" data-game="wow" data-type="currency" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/currency=395/justice-points">
<span>
<img alt="Justice Points" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/pvecurrency-justice.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Justice Points</span></span></a> or <a class="q3 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=57868/anraphets-regalia">
<img alt="Anraphet's Regalia" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_chest_robe_dungeonrobe_c_03.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Anraphet's Regalia</span></a> from <a data-entity="zone" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/zone=4945/halls-of-origination">
<span class="tinyicontxt">Halls of Origination</span></a> Heroic.<br/>
<br/>
<b>Recommended BiS Chest Enchant</b>: <a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/spell=74250/enchant-chest-peerless-stats">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_enchant_formulagood_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Enchant Chest - Peerless Stats</span></a>
