<h4 class="heading-size-4" id="wrist-for-holy-priest-healer">Wrist for Holy Priest Healer</h4>There aren't many options available for the Wrist slot and any of the below options are all viable, using <a href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/guide/item-reforging-overview">Reforging</a> to obtain more Haste or Spirit as necessary.<br/>
<br/>
<b>Recommended BiS Bracer Enchant</b>: <a class="q3 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=68786/enchant-bracer-mighty-intellect">
<img alt="Enchant Bracer - Mighty Intellect" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_enchantedscroll.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Enchant Bracer - Mighty Intellect</span></a> or <a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/spell=85010/draconic-embossment-intellect">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/trade_leatherworking.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Draconic Embossment - Intellect</span></a> for Leatherworkers, with <a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/spell=55628/socket-bracer">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/item_socketedbracer.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Socket Bracer</span></a> - Only Blacksmiths may apply additional Sockets on their own Bracers.<div class="pad"></div>
