<h4 class="heading-size-4" id="legs-for-holy-priest-healer">Legs for Holy Priest Healer</h4>
<a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=60261/mercurial-legwraps">
<img alt="Mercurial Legwraps" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_pant_cloth_raidpriest_i_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Mercurial Legwraps</span></a> are the second item you'll want to save your <a class="icontiny q1" data-entity="currency" data-game="wow" data-type="currency" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/currency=396/valor-points">
<span>
<img alt="Valor Points" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/pvecurrency-valor.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Valor Points</span></span></a> for after you've got the Robe, as there is an opportunity to get these legs in <a data-entity="zone" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/zone=5600/baradin-hold">
<span class="tinyicontxt">Baradin Hold</span></a>, which is similar to the VoA raid in Wrath of the Lich King.<br/>
<br/>In the meantime, <a class="q3 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=58160/leggings-of-charity">
<img alt="Leggings of Charity" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_pants_robe_dungeonrobe_c_04.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Leggings of Charity</span></a> are the best alternative for you to use, after the crafted options from <a class="icontiny" data-entity="skill" data-game="wow" data-type="skill" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/skill=197/tailoring">
<img alt="Tailoring" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/trade_tailoring.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Tailoring</span></a>.<br/>
<br/>
<b>Recommended BiS Leg Armor:</b> <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=54450/powerful-ghostly-spellthread">
<img alt="Powerful Ghostly Spellthread" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/spell_nature_astralrecalgroup.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Powerful Ghostly Spellthread</span></a>
