<div class="pad"></div>
<h4 class="heading-size-4" id="trinkets-for-holy-priest-healer">Trinkets for Holy Priest Healer</h4>The best two trinkets are undoubtably <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=64645/tyrandes-favorite-doll">
<img alt="Tyrande's Favorite Doll" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/trade_archaeology_tyrandesfavoritedoll.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Tyrande's Favorite Doll</span></a> and <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=62050/darkmoon-card-tsunami">
<img alt="Darkmoon Card: Tsunami" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_inscription_tarot_tsunamicard.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Darkmoon Card: Tsunami</span></a> and are certainly worth the time and gold investment if you can afford it.<br/>
<br/>You may also opt to use <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=68777/vibrant-alchemist-stone">
<img alt="Vibrant Alchemist Stone" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/item_alchemiststonec.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Vibrant Alchemist Stone</span></a> if you're an Alchemist, and the overall MP5 gained from this trinket varies depending on the fight length, making it stronger than all the other Trinkets listed if your boss kills are 2 minutes or under.<br/>
<br/>Another great option, which is easier to obtain is <a class="q3 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=56351/tear-of-blood">
<img alt="Tear of Blood" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/spell_shadow_lifedrain.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Tear of Blood</span></a> from <a data-entity="zone" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/zone=5088/the-stonecore">
<span class="tinyicontxt">The Stonecore</span></a>.<div class="pad"></div>
