<h3 class="heading-size-3" id="weapons">Weapons for Holy Priest Healer</h3>
<div class="pad"></div>
<h4 class="heading-size-4" id="staves-for-holy-priest-healer">Staves for Holy Priest Healer</h4>
<a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=64880/staff-of-ammunae">
<img alt="Staff of Ammunae" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/trade_archaeology_staff-of-ammunrae.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Staff of Ammunae</span></a> is the best Weapon option for a Holy Priest from <a class="icontiny" data-entity="skill" data-game="wow" data-type="skill" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/skill=794/archaeology">
<img alt="Archaeology" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/trade_archaeology.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Archaeology</span></a> due to the great amount if Spirit it provides, however, if you haven't been lucky enough to find this yet, <a class="q3 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=56424/soul-releaser">
<img alt="Soul Releaser" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_staff_116.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Soul Releaser</span></a> is the next best Staff option.<br/>
<br/>
<b>Recommended BiS Weapon Enchants</b>: <a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/spell=74242/enchant-weapon-power-torrent">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_enchant_formulasuperior_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Enchant Weapon - Power Torrent</span></a>
