<h4 class="heading-size-4" id="wands-for-holy-priest-healer">Wands for Holy Priest Healer</h4>There aren't many Wand options available, which makes the choice fairly simple, with <a class="q3 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=56446/wand-of-untainted-power">
<img alt="Wand of Untainted Power" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_wand_1h_cataclysm_c_03.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Wand of Untainted Power</span></a> being the best option and <a class="q3 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=65172/cookies-stirring-rod">
<img alt="Cookie's Stirring Rod" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_staff_02.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Cookie's Stirring Rod</span></a> being a decent alternative, where we can use <a href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/guide/item-reforging-overview">Reforging</a> for more desirable stats.<div class="pad"></div>
